{%- comment -%} Modal wrapper for dynamic product content {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="modal-wrapper">
  <div id="dynamic-product-content" class="scroll-trigger animate--slide-in"></div>
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Shopper Approved merchant (group2.0) widget.

  Not loaded on product pages while the Shopper Approved product-review display
  is enabled. The two widgets are the same codebase: they share the globals
  sa_rtype, sa_overall, sa_foundrows and sa_product_reviews, and both render into
  #product_page and #review_header. Whichever finishes last wins, so with both on
  a product page the merchant widget intermittently replaces a product's reviews
  with the site-wide set — 428 store reviews in place of the product's own.

  Harmless before the product display existed, because a product page had none of
  those elements for either widget to write into. With
  settings.sa_product_reviews_enabled off, this is byte-identical to before.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign load_sa_merchant_widget = true
  if settings.sa_product_reviews_enabled and request.page_type == 'product'
    assign load_sa_merchant_widget = false
  endif
-%}
{%- if load_sa_merchant_widget -%}
  <script type="text/javascript" defer>
    function saLoadScript(src) {
      var js = window.document.createElement('script');
      js.src = src;
      js.type = 'text/javascript';
      document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(js);
    }
    saLoadScript('https://www.shopperapproved.com/widgets/group2.0/34099.js');
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} Drawer visibility fix {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .drawer {visibility: hidden;}
</style>
